\end{equation}
Using inner regularity,
pick a compact subset
$S^4$ of $S^3$ of positive measure.

We define recursively 
for $\ell\in \mathbb{N}_0$  a number $k_{\ell-1}$  
and a  finite collection $\mathcal{I}_\ell$ of arcs of length less than $10^7m_{k_{\ell-1}}^{-1}$ with
\begin{equation} \label{tfive104}
     S^4\subset \bigcup\limits_{I \in \mathcal{I}_\ell} I 
\, ,
\end{equation}
\begin{equation}\label{tfive106}
\|\sum_{I \in \mathcal{I}_\ell}\mathbf{1}_I\|_{L^\infty(\T)}\le 2\, .
