We use the approximation Lemma \ref{approximation with A B C D} at the center of $J$ with $C=10^8$, the upper bound given by \eqref{eq:ortho_polys_det2} on the one-sided orthogonal polynomials, and \eqref{tfive100}, to estimate \eqref{tfive8} from above by
\begin{equation}\label{tfive9}
  \le   |J|- \frac 1 4 \int\limits_J (|A_ls^l+B_l|-|A_hs^h+B_h|)^2 \, d|s|+ 10^{-200}\eta^8|J|\, .
