and if $\min(|A_h|,|B_h|)< 10^{-2}\eta$,
we use estimate \eqref{tfive108} with $m_k(s) = m_k$ and Lemma \ref{unbalanced} to estimate \eqref{tfive9} from above by
\begin{equation}\label{tfive10} 
(1-10^{-100}\eta^8)|J|  \, .
