The corresponding electromagnetic polarizabilities extracted from Eq.~\eqref{eq:UV_fig_b_2_TN} are  
\begin{equation}\label{eq:ab_b6_b2_TN}  
    \alpha^{(b^\prime)}_{E}(\xi) = 0, \quad \beta^{(b^\prime)}_{M}(\xi) = -\frac{\alpha_{\mathrm{em}} b_2^2 Q_{\mathcal{TN}}^2}{6 M_\mathcal{N}^2} \frac{1}{\delta}.  
