The diagram in Fig.~\ref{fig:fmdiagrams_full}($b^\prime$) represents purely magnetic polarizability through the inclusion of a $\delta$ pole term. A comparable effect is observed when evaluating the contribution of $\Delta$-baryons to nucleon polarizabilities, as analyzed in~\cite{Schumacher:2005an,Holstein:2013kia,Hemmert:1996rw,Pascalutsa:2002pi}.

