where $C_\xi$ represents the coefficients for different baryons, as listed in Table~\ref{tab:C_xi}. The coefficient $C_\xi$ is proportional to the transition magnetic moment obtained at leading order in HB$\chi$PT, following the same manner as in Eq.~\eqref{44},~\eqref{45} and \eqref{eq:transition_LO}:  
