In Eqs.~\eqref{eq:U_6_c}--\eqref{eq:V_6_g}, we have considered the contributions from the crossed diagrams. $\chi$ denotes a specific meson in Eq.~\eqref{eq:octet_meson}, and $M_\chi$ represents its mass. $D_{\xi,\chi}$ are the coefficients of the loops, which are given in Table~\ref{tab:loop_cofficients}. $A$ is a common factor
