%\]
How rich this class of functions is depends on the specifications of $\bx \mapsto \psi_i(\bx;\bgam)$. In addition, we propose taking the discontinuity link function as $g(z) = z_+$, so that the jumps $j(\bx)$ cannot be negative. 
