This is given by the following problem on $\Gamma_t=(\mathcal{V}_t,\mathcal{E}_t)$, where $\mathcal{V}_t=\{v^0_t,v^1_t\}$ and $\mathcal{E}_t = \{e^1_t\}$, choosing $b^1_t$ pointing away from $v^0_t$:
\begin{subequations}\label{eq:simple_tip}
