\textbf{Computational Considerations:}

To implement this formula numerically, one would need to follow these steps:

\begin{enumerate}
    \item Simulate the paths of the SDE to compute \(X_t\), \(Y_t\), and \(Z_t\) over a discretised time grid.

    \item Calculate the Malliavin covariance matrix \(\gamma_{X_T}\) and its inverse \(\gamma_{X_T}^{-1}\).

    \item Compute \(F_k = Y_T^\top \gamma_{X_T}^{-1} e_k\) for the desired component index \(k\).

    \item Approximate the stochastic integral \(\left. \int_0^T u_t(x) \cdot dB_t \right|_{x=F_k}\) using appropriate numerical methods such as Euler-Maruyama.

