This formula for \(\delta(u_k)\) provides a structured and computationally feasible approach to computing the Skorokhod integral in the general case. The hierarchical decomposition into components \(A_{jk}(t)\), \(B_{jk}(t)\), and \(C_{jk}(t)\), along with the auxiliary processes \(\Omega(t)\), \(\Theta(t,s)\), and related terms, enhances clarity and modularity in implementation.

