\subsection{Gamma Pass Rate Analysis}


To further evaluate the predicted radiotherapy plans, we computed the gamma pass rate~\cite{Wendling2007} using \(3\%/3\) mm criteria for dose values exceeding 10\% of the maximum to assess overall dose distribution and for values above 90\% to focus on high-dose regions critical for target coverage.

