    \centering    \includegraphics[width=0.5\linewidth]{figures/H_rec.pdf}
    \caption{\justifying Hubble parameter $H(z)$ as a function of redshift. The black curve shows the predicted evolution of $H(z)$ from the best-fit cosmological model reconstructed by \texttt{ReFANN}, while the green region represents the $1 \sigma$ uncertainty. The red points correspond to CC data and their respective uncertainties.}
