while \cite{james2022measurement} obtained $H_0 = 73^{+12}_{-8}~\mathrm{km}~\mathrm{s}^{-1}~\mathrm{Mpc}^{-1}$ assuming a log-normal distribution with $e^{\mu} = 186^{+59}_{-48}$ and $\sigma_{\rm host} = 3.5~\mathrm{pc}~\mathrm{cm}^{-3}$.

