To illustrate how to apply the theoretical results from Section~\ref{sec:main}, I revisit the three examples introduced in Section~\ref{sec:models} to identify the conditions for extinction and permanence. Each example demonstrates different aspects of the theory while raising open research questions and providing new biological insights.

