Figure~\ref{fig:simul.detect} displays the relative regrets involving the loss function $l_{\text{d}}(\cdot,\cdot,c)$ as defined in \eqref{eq:loss.detect}: 
\begin{equation}
	\frac{
		\hat{\mathbb{E}}[l_{\text{d}}(\hat{\mu},\mu,c)] - 
		\hat{\mathbb{E}}[l_{\text{d}}(\hat{\mu}^*,\mu,c)]
	}{
		\hat{\mathbb{E}}[l_{\text{d}}(\hat{\mu}^*,\mu,c)]
	}
	\qquad 
