In this section, we describe how we obtain the solutions to Problems \ref{problem:PACbound} and \ref{problem:PACoptimal_diff}.
In Section \ref{subsection:ProbGuarantee}, we provide the solutions $\eta_N$ and $\zeta_N$ to Problem \ref{problem:PACbound} using parameter sampling.
