where ${J}^u_{\mathcal{C}, \mathcal{S}} = [0, {\xi}^u_{\mathcal{C}, \mathcal{S}}]$ and $\mathcal{U}'_N \subseteq \mathcal{U}_N$. We denote the solution of (\ref{SCP_for_thm2}) by ${\xi}^*_{\mathcal{C}, \mathcal{S}}$. Note that ${\xi}^*_{\mathcal{C}, \mathcal{S}} = \min_{u \in \mathcal{U}'_N} {\xi}^u_{\mathcal{C}, \mathcal{S}}$.
\begin{proof}[Proof of Theorem \ref{thm_optimality}]
