Then, Lemma \ref{lemma_recall_optimality_max} states that the solution defined by (\ref{C_star}) accomplishes the maximum lower bound for the recall-optimal probability, that is the solution satisfies \textbf{(PC1)} in Problem \ref{problem:PACoptimal_diff}, based on Lemma \ref{lemma_recall_optimal_necessary_sufficient}.
